<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: You can dismiss letters and messages by right-clicking on them. -->
  <GameplayTips.DismissLetters>حذف نامه‌ها</GameplayTips.DismissLetters>
  <!-- EN: You can hold the shift key to queue orders on your colonists. -->
  <GameplayTips.QueueOrders>صف‌گذاری دستورات</GameplayTips.QueueOrders>
  <!-- EN: You can right-click and drag to reorder colonists on the colonist bar. -->
  <GameplayTips.ReorderColonistbar>بازچینی نوار مستعمره‌نشینان</GameplayTips.ReorderColonistbar>
  <!-- EN: You can select the previous or next colonist with the , and . keys. -->
  <GameplayTips.SelectPrevNextColonist>انتخاب مستعمره‌نشین قبلی/بعدی</GameplayTips.SelectPrevNextColonist>
  <!-- EN: Many menus allow you to click and drag a setting to 'paint' it over many entries. This even works for things like outfits or food restrictions. -->
  <GameplayTips.SettingPainting>رنگ‌آمیزی تنظیمات</GameplayTips.SettingPainting>
  <!-- EN: In the work tab's manual priorities mode, 1 is first priority, while 4 is last priority. -->
  <GameplayTips.ManualPriorities>اولویت‌های دستی</GameplayTips.ManualPriorities>
  <!-- EN: Each colonists' mood is displayed in the background of their icon in the colonist bar at the top of the screen. -->
  <GameplayTips.ColonistMood>حالت روحی مستعمره‌نشین</GameplayTips.ColonistMood>
  <!-- EN: Shift-clicking the name of a work type in the Work tab changes settings for all colonists at once. -->
  <GameplayTips.WorkTabChangeAllColonists>تغییر تنظیمات برای همه مستعمره‌نشینان</GameplayTips.WorkTabChangeAllColonists>
  <!-- EN: Right-clicking a number in the Work tab using manual priorities will reduce the priority instead of increasing it. -->
  <GameplayTips.WorkTabDecreasePriority>کاهش اولویت در تب کار</GameplayTips.WorkTabDecreasePriority>
  <!-- EN: You can hold the alt key to show detailed information about a specific tile. -->
  <GameplayTips.CellInspector>بازرسی سلول</GameplayTips.CellInspector>
  <!-- EN: In a gunfight, always be behind cover! Right-click and drag to have your drafted fighters form a line. -->
  <GameplayTips.GunfightCover>پوشش در نبرد</GameplayTips.GunfightCover>
  <!-- EN: Right-click and drag to have your drafted fighters form a line. Bunched-up targets are easy to hit! -->
  <GameplayTips.GunfightSpread>پراکندگی در نبرد</GameplayTips.GunfightSpread>
  <!-- EN: Smoke totally prevents turrets from detecting targets, but people can still shoot with reduced accuracy. -->
  <GameplayTips.ShootingAccuracySmoke>دقت شلیک در دود</GameplayTips.ShootingAccuracySmoke>
  <!-- EN: When designing defences, assume enemies will get inside using drop pods or tunnels. Build internal defensive positions. -->
  <GameplayTips.DesignDefenses>طراحی دفاعیات</GameplayTips.DesignDefenses>
  <!-- EN: Foggy or rainy weather reduces the accuracy of ranged weapons. -->
  <GameplayTips.ShootingAccuracyFogRain>دقت شلیک در مه/باران</GameplayTips.ShootingAccuracyFogRain>
  <!-- EN: You can analyze the chance a shot will hit by selecting the shooter and placing the mouse over the target. -->
  <GameplayTips.ShootingTooltip>راهنمای شلیک</GameplayTips.ShootingTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Turrets explode when they take a lot of damage. Don't put them too close together, and don't put your people too close to them. -->
  <GameplayTips.TurretsExplode>انفجار برجک‌ها</GameplayTips.TurretsExplode>
  <!-- EN: Some animals explode upon death. You can use transport pods to drop animals on enemies. Think about it. -->
  <GameplayTips.AnimalDeathExplosion>انفجار مرگ حیوان</GameplayTips.AnimalDeathExplosion>
  <!-- EN: If you need help in a fight, call your allies using the comms console. -->
  <GameplayTips.CallAllies>درخواست کمک از متحدان</GameplayTips.CallAllies>
  <!-- EN: Maddened animals will attack any human, including your enemies. You can use this. -->
  <GameplayTips.MaddenedAnimals>حیوانات دیوانه</GameplayTips.MaddenedAnimals>
  <!-- EN: EMP bursts will temporarily disable turrets and shields. -->
  <GameplayTips.EMPDisablesTurretsShields>EMP غیرفعال‌سازی برجک‌ها و سپرها</GameplayTips.EMPDisablesTurretsShields>
  <!-- EN: EMP bursts instantly break personal shields. -->
  <GameplayTips.EMPDisablesPersonalShields>EMP غیرفعال‌سازی سپرهای شخصی</GameplayTips.EMPDisablesPersonalShields>
  <!-- EN: The hunter stealth stat reduces the chance of animal attacks. It is affected by the hunter's animals and shooting skills. -->
  <GameplayTips.HunterStealth>مهارت مخفی‌گری شکارچی</GameplayTips.HunterStealth>
  <!-- EN: Animals are more likely to attack when harmed from close range. Long-range, slow-firing weapons are safest for hunting. -->
  <GameplayTips.AnimalsAttackCloseRange>حیوانات در نزدیک‌برد حمله می‌کنند</GameplayTips.AnimalsAttackCloseRange>
  <!-- EN: Entire herds of animals may attack you when you try to hunt them. Accept the risk before hunting, or choose weaker prey. -->
  <GameplayTips.AnimalsMayAttack>حیوانات ممکن است حمله کنند</GameplayTips.AnimalsMayAttack>
  <!-- EN: If you hunt boomrats and boomalopes when it's raining, their deaths won't cause forest fires. -->
  <GameplayTips.AnimalDeathExplosionRain>انفجار مرگ حیوان در باران</GameplayTips.AnimalDeathExplosionRain>
  <!-- EN: Carefully-slaughtered animals yield more meat and leather than those who were killed violently. -->
  <GameplayTips.GreaterSlaughterYield>بازدهٔ بزرگتر کشتار</GameplayTips.GreaterSlaughterYield>
  <!-- EN: Place the caravan hitching spot where you want your caravans to form up. It's usually best to place it near your storage areas. -->
  <GameplayTips.CaravanHitchingSpot>نقطهٔ توقف کاروان</GameplayTips.CaravanHitchingSpot>
  <!-- EN: During encounters away from home, you can place a caravan hitching spot to keep your animals from wandering. -->
  <GameplayTips.CaravanHitchingSpotRoamers>نقطهٔ توقف کاروان برای سرگردان‌ها</GameplayTips.CaravanHitchingSpotRoamers>
  <!-- EN: Caravans move faster if they include rideable animals like horses, donkeys and dromedaries. -->
  <GameplayTips.CaravanRideableAnimals>حیوانات سوارکار کاروان</GameplayTips.CaravanRideableAnimals>
  <!-- EN: Smaller caravans get attacked less often because they're less visible. -->
  <GameplayTips.CaravanSmallerLessVisible>کاروان‌های کوچکتر کمتر دیده می‌شوند</GameplayTips.CaravanSmallerLessVisible>
  <!-- EN: Before forming a caravan, collect the items you want to send in a stockpile near your caravan hitching spot. This will make packing much faster. -->
  <GameplayTips.CaravanStockpileNearPackingSpot>انبار نزدیک نقطه بسته‌بندی کاروان</GameplayTips.CaravanStockpileNearPackingSpot>
  <!-- EN: If you have untrained animals in your caravan, you can split them into a separate caravan before attacking an enemy, to keep them out of the fight. -->
  <GameplayTips.CaravanUntrainedAnimals>حیوانات آموزش‌نشدهٔ کاروان</GameplayTips.CaravanUntrainedAnimals>
  <!-- EN: Don't forget to pack medicine on your caravans. -->
  <GameplayTips.CaravanDontForgetMedicine>فراموش نکنید دارو بسته‌بندی کنید</GameplayTips.CaravanDontForgetMedicine>
  <!-- EN: RimWorld is a story generator, not a skill test. A ruined colony is a dramatic tragedy, not a failure. -->
  <GameplayTips.StoryGenerator>ژنراتور داستان</GameplayTips.StoryGenerator>
  <!-- EN: Some colonists are worse than useless. Bad allies are part of the challenge. -->
  <GameplayTips.BadAllies>متحدان بد</GameplayTips.BadAllies>
  <!-- EN: If you can't defend against a threat, make a caravan and run. You may lose your home, but your story can continue. -->
  <GameplayTips.MakeCaravanRunBeforeDefeat>اجرا کاروان قبل از شکست</GameplayTips.MakeCaravanRunBeforeDefeat>
  <!-- EN: When you have more wealth, more powerful enemies attack. If you want the challenge to scale with time instead, select 'Wealth-independent progress mode' in the storyteller settings. -->
  <GameplayTips.FixedWealthMode>حالت ثروت ثابت</GameplayTips.FixedWealthMode>
  <!-- EN: Avoid using stone for doors. They open very slowly, which wastes your colonists' time. -->
  <GameplayTips.StoneDoors>درهای سنگی</GameplayTips.StoneDoors>
  <!-- EN: Put chairs in front of workbenches so workers can sit comfortably while working. -->
  <GameplayTips.ChairsWorkbench>صندلی‌های پیش‌کارگاه</GameplayTips.ChairsWorkbench>
  <!-- EN: Mechanical structures break down and require replacement components. Don't build things you don't need. -->
  <GameplayTips.MechanicalBreakdown>خرابی مکانیکی</GameplayTips.MechanicalBreakdown>
  <!-- EN: Be careful what you construct on bridges. Bridges collapse easily under explosions, and your buildings will go with them. -->
  <GameplayTips.CarefulConstructionOnBridges>ساخت محتاطانه بر روی پل‌ها</GameplayTips.CarefulConstructionOnBridges>
  <!-- EN: Clean rooms increase research speed, improve medical outcomes, and reduce food poisoning. Sterile tiles make rooms extra-clean. -->
  <GameplayTips.CleanRooms>اتاق‌های تمیز</GameplayTips.CleanRooms>
  <!-- EN: Building your whole colony in one structure saves resources, but also makes it difficult to contain fires. -->
  <GameplayTips.ColonyOneStructure>کلونی یک ساختار</GameplayTips.ColonyOneStructure>
  <!-- EN: Terrain affects movement speed. Build floors to help your colonists get around quicker. -->
  <GameplayTips.TerrainMovementSpeed>سرعت حرکت زمین</GameplayTips.TerrainMovementSpeed>
  <!-- EN: Different terrain has different inherent cleanliness levels. Tiles are inherently clean; dirt is inherently dirty. -->
  <GameplayTips.TerrainCleanliness>تمیزی زمین</GameplayTips.TerrainCleanliness>
  <!-- EN: Some floor types are faster to clean than others. It takes much longer to clean carpet compared to metal tile. -->
  <GameplayTips.TerrainCleanSpeed>سرعت تمیزی زمین</GameplayTips.TerrainCleanSpeed>
  <!-- EN: You can give prisoners as gifts. Giving a prisoner back to their own faction will be highly appreciated. -->
  <GameplayTips.PrisonersAsGifts>زندانیان به عنوان هدیه</GameplayTips.PrisonersAsGifts>
  <!-- EN: You can request specific types of trade caravans using the comms console. -->
  <GameplayTips.RequestTradeCaravans>درخواست کاروان‌های تجاری</GameplayTips.RequestTradeCaravans>
  <!-- EN: You can use transport pods to send gifts directly to other factions' bases - even your enemies. This improves faction relations. -->
  <GameplayTips.TransportPodsSendGift>پادهای حمل‌ونقل هدیه می‌فرستند</GameplayTips.TransportPodsSendGift>
  <!-- EN: Keeping prisoners together saves space. However, prisoners kept together will try to break out together. -->
  <GameplayTips.KeepingPrisonersTogether>نگهداری زندانیان با هم</GameplayTips.KeepingPrisonersTogether>
  <!-- EN: Enemy faction bases are very well-defended. You don't need to attack them - but be well-prepared if you choose to try. -->
  <GameplayTips.EnemyFactionBaseDefenses>دفاعات پایگاه دشمن</GameplayTips.EnemyFactionBaseDefenses>
  <!-- EN: Cute tame animals will nuzzle your colonists, improving their mood. -->
  <GameplayTips.AnimalNuzzle>نوزل حیوان</GameplayTips.AnimalNuzzle>
  <!-- EN: Assign your herbivorous animals to areas with lots of grass. They'll eat the grass and spare you the need to feed them. -->
  <GameplayTips.AnimalHerbivorousGrassArea>منطقهٔ علف‌دار حیوانات علف‌خوار</GameplayTips.AnimalHerbivorousGrassArea>
  <!-- EN: If someone has a serious infection in a limb, you can remove the limb to save their life. -->
  <GameplayTips.RemoveLimbInfection>حذف عفونت اندام</GameplayTips.RemoveLimbInfection>
  <!-- EN: Sloshing through water makes people unhappy. Build a bridge when you can. -->
  <GameplayTips.SloshingWater>آب‌پاشی</GameplayTips.SloshingWater>
  <!-- EN: Luciferium can heal scars - even those on the eye or brain. It is, however, a permanent commitment. -->
  <GameplayTips.Luciferium>لوسیفریوم</GameplayTips.Luciferium>
  <!-- EN: Work and movement speed are affected by lighting. Everything is slower in the dark. -->
  <GameplayTips.WorkMovementSpeedLighting>سرعت کار و حرکت در نور</GameplayTips.WorkMovementSpeedLighting>
  <!-- EN: Deep underground caverns have a naturally stable temperature, even if it's very hot or cold outside. -->
  <GameplayTips.DeepCavesTemperature>دمای غارهای عمیق</GameplayTips.DeepCavesTemperature>
  <!-- EN: Mountain bases are easy to defend. The downside is that people go crazy spending too long underground. And giant insects. -->
  <GameplayTips.MountainBases>پایگاه‌های کوهستانی</GameplayTips.MountainBases>
  <!-- EN: Prisoners will join much quicker and attempt fewer breakouts when they're in a good mood. -->
  <GameplayTips.PrisonersGoodMood>حالت روحی خوب زندانیان</GameplayTips.PrisonersGoodMood>
  <!-- EN: You can have multiple researchers working simultaneously at multiple research tables. -->
  <GameplayTips.MultipleResearchers>پژوهشگران متعدد</GameplayTips.MultipleResearchers>
  <!-- EN: Geysers heat up rooms if enclosed. This can be dangerous, or useful. -->
  <GameplayTips.GeysersHeatRooms>چشمه‌های آبگرم اتاق‌ها</GameplayTips.GeysersHeatRooms>
  <!-- EN: Explosions extinguish fires in their blast radius. This makes artillery shells useful for stopping fires when there is no other choice. -->
  <GameplayTips.ExtinguishFireArtillery>خاموش کردن آتش با توپخانه</GameplayTips.ExtinguishFireArtillery>
  <!-- EN: Even serious setbacks don't mean the game has to end. Try playing out a lost battle - often the best stories come from the darkest situations. -->
  <GameplayTips.BestStoriesFromDarkestSituations>بهترین داستان‌ها از تاریک‌ترین موقعیت‌ها</GameplayTips.BestStoriesFromDarkestSituations>
  <!-- EN: Keep weapon stockpiles away from your prisons. Prison breaks are much more dangerous with guns and explosives. -->
  <GameplayTips.KeepWeaponsAwayFromPrisoners>نگهداری سلاح‌ها دور از زندانیان</GameplayTips.KeepWeaponsAwayFromPrisoners>
  <!-- EN: When taming animals, make sure you have enough food of the correct type to feed them. -->
  <GameplayTips.MakeSureYouHaveFoodForTamedAnimals>اطمینان از غذای حیوانات رام‌شده</GameplayTips.MakeSureYouHaveFoodForTamedAnimals>
  <!-- EN: Dropping a stone or slag chunk in a doorway will force it open, leaving you vulnerable to hostile wildlife and raiders. -->
  <GameplayTips.DroppingChunksWillForceDoorsOpen>انداختن قطعات درب را باز می‌کند</GameplayTips.DroppingChunksWillForceDoorsOpen>
  <!-- EN: Clean labs with sterile tile give research speed bonuses. -->
  <GameplayTips.CleanLabs>آزمایشگاه‌های تمیز</GameplayTips.CleanLabs>
  <!-- EN: You can change storyteller and playstyle at any time through the options menu. -->
  <GameplayTips.ChangeStoryteller>تغییر روایتگر</GameplayTips.ChangeStoryteller>
  <!-- EN: The more factions you are allied with, the more random traders and military aid you will receive. -->
  <GameplayTips.MoreAlliesMoreTraders>متحدان بیشتر، تجار بیشتر</GameplayTips.MoreAlliesMoreTraders>
  <!-- EN: You can use drug policies to have your fighters carry combat drugs like go-juice. A quick dose at the start of combat can win the battle. -->
  <GameplayTips.CombatDrugsFromInventory>داروهای مبارزه از موجودی</GameplayTips.CombatDrugsFromInventory>
  <!-- EN: Set schedules with long stretches of one activity to minimize travel time. -->
  <GameplayTips.SchedulesSetLong>برنامه‌های طولانی</GameplayTips.SchedulesSetLong>
  <!-- EN: Straw matting ignores filth. Use it as the floor for your barn. -->
  <GameplayTips.StrawMatting>پوشش کاه</GameplayTips.StrawMatting>
  <!-- EN: Some animals produce a lot of filth. Keep your elephants and cattle outside. -->
  <GameplayTips.AnimalFilth>کثیفی حیوانات</GameplayTips.AnimalFilth>
  <!-- EN: Predators won't hunt animals which are on the other side of fences or barricades. -->
  <GameplayTips.PredatorsAndFences>شکارچیان و حصارها</GameplayTips.PredatorsAndFences>
  <!-- EN: It's never game over. If everyone is dead or gone, you can create new wanderers to take over the remains of your colony. -->
  <GameplayTips.NeverGameOver>هرگز تمام نشدن بازی</GameplayTips.NeverGameOver>
  <!-- EN: Store books in bookcases. This increases the beauty of a room, makes nearby research benches faster, and increases the XP and recreation gained from reading. -->
  <GameplayTips.StoreBooksInBookcases>ذخیره کتاب‌ها در قفسه‌ها</GameplayTips.StoreBooksInBookcases>
  <!-- EN: Want a newly crafted item to be taken to a specific shelf? Once a shelf is named or linked with other shelves, it will appear as a hauling destination in the bill's “Details...” window. -->
  <GameplayTips.TakeToShelves>بردن به قفسه‌ها</GameplayTips.TakeToShelves>
  <!-- EN: You can change to a 12 hour clock, or change Celsius temperatures to Fahrenheit, in the options menu. -->
  <GameplayTips.ChangeUnits>تغییر واحدها</GameplayTips.ChangeUnits>
  <!-- EN: When targeting a colonist with an ability or item, you can also target their portrait in the top colonist bar. -->
  <GameplayTips.TargetColonistBar>هدف‌گیری نوار مستعمره‌نشین</GameplayTips.TargetColonistBar>
  <!-- EN: Some buildings are more efficient if they're in a dedicated room. Workbenches in their own room make a workshop. Research benches in their own room make a laboratory. -->
  <GameplayTips.WorkTableRoomRole>نقش اتاق میز کار</GameplayTips.WorkTableRoomRole>
  <!-- EN: You can rename bills in the bill details dialog. -->
  <GameplayTips.RenamingBills>تغییر نام فاکتورها</GameplayTips.RenamingBills>
  <!-- EN: Friendly fire can't happen if the shooter is close to their ally. You can safely put melee colonists in front of gun-wielding colonists. -->
  <GameplayTips.FriendlyFire>آتش‌سوزی دوستانه</GameplayTips.FriendlyFire>
  <!-- EN: Right-click on certain buttons in the orders menu for additional options. For example, you can forbid all items on a map or cancel all hunting jobs. -->
  <GameplayTips.RightClickGizmos>آیکون‌های کلیک راست</GameplayTips.RightClickGizmos>
  <!-- EN: Hold the shift key while scrolling the map to scroll faster. -->
  <GameplayTips.FastScroll>اسکرول سریع</GameplayTips.FastScroll>
  <!-- EN: Shelves aren't just for show. They increase your storage capacity by holding multiple items on the same spot. -->
  <GameplayTips.Shelves>قفسه‌ها</GameplayTips.Shelves>
  <!-- EN: Mechanoids have some psychic sensitivity. Use a psychic lance on one to turn a fight. -->
  <GameplayTips.MechanoidPsychicSensitivity>حساسیت روانی مکانوئید</GameplayTips.MechanoidPsychicSensitivity>
  <!-- EN: Most colonists hate eating insect meat. Turn it into chemfuel using a biofuel refinery. -->
  <GameplayTips.InsectMeat>گوشت حشره</GameplayTips.InsectMeat>
  <!-- EN: Pressing Z will let you search the map for items, creatures, buildings, and more. You can search the world map too. -->
  <GameplayTips.MapSearch>جستجوی نقشه</GameplayTips.MapSearch>
  
</LanguageData>